quran[13]{c,v,t}:
  18,98,"He (Dhu al-Qarnayn) said: ‘This is a mercy from my Lord (to hold back the terrors of Gog and Magog from the people). But when my Lord’s promise (of the Last Hour) comes, He will (demolish this barrier and) level it to the ground (or reduce it to dust particles). And my Lord’s promise always comes true.’"
  18,99,"On that Day, We shall let them surge like waves over one another. Later, the Trumpet will be blown, and We will gather them all."
  18,100,"And on that Day, We shall present the Hellfire, fully exposed to the disbelievers,"
  18,101,those whose eyes were covered from My remembrance and could not hear.
  18,102,"Do the disbelievers suppose they may take My servants as (their) guardians besides Me? Indeed, We have prepared Hell as a reception for the disbelievers."
  18,103,Say: ‘Shall We inform you about the biggest losers in (respect to their) deeds?
  18,104,(They are) those whose efforts in this world are misguided while they think they are doing good work.’
  18,105,"They are the ones who disbelieve in the signs of their Lord and the meeting with Him. So their deeds have come to nothing. On the Day of Resurrection, We shall not give them any weight."
  18,106,That is their recompense—Hell—for they disbelieved and took My revelations and My Messengers in mockery.
  18,107,"Indeed, those who believe and perform righteous deeds shall have the Gardens of Paradise as (their) reception (and hospitality),"
  18,108,"abiding in them forever, from where they will never wish to move."
  18,109,"Say: ‘If the ocean were ink for the Words of my Lord, the ocean would surely run dry before the Words of my Lord are finished, even if we brought another like it to help.’"
  18,110,"Say: ‘I am only a human being like you. It has been revealed to me that your God is (only) One God. So whoever hopes for the meeting with his Lord, let him perform righteous deeds and not associate anyone in the worship of his Lord.’"
